app or something like that that's going to involve a lot of fairly cookie-cutter stuff or crud back-end. Any of those kinds of examples,

10:01.519 --> 10:08.879
it's going to lend itself nicely to the more 2026 mindset to these kinds of approaches.

10:10.879 --> 10:17.200
That's how I would think about it. It depends on the kind of project that you're working on,

10:17.200 --> 10:20.259
and it depends on your risk appetite and on

10:20.259 --> 10:24.440
whether it's it's sort of mission critical or not and I am you can probably

10:24.440 --> 10:29.480
imagine I'm going to say this but for me for most of what I work on I am more

