11:37.840 --> 11:52.299
the more mission critical, large code base, real enterprise development patterns, how to use this in anger with a good nod towards the more 2026 mindset kinds of techniques.

11:52.299 --> 11:58.080
But the one thing I want to stress beyond all that else is, and this is particular,

