12:06.580 --> 12:11.840
And this is particularly for people who are more towards the beginning of their technology

12:11.840 --> 12:19.799
career, is that your job in working in this field is to deliver code that's proven to

12:19.799 --> 12:24.559
work and it's no good to blame the LLM.

12:24.559 --> 12:28.480
By all means you should use LLM's to help you for sure.

